OL,3,GNEWSACharity's desperate search as its
OL,4,A'overwhelmed'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity which helps wild animals and
OL,7,Fdomestic pets in Wirral said it has
OL,8,Fbeen "overwhelmed" with animals needing
OL,9,Fcare.
OL,11,FCelandine Wood Animal Rescue cares for
OL,12,Fwild animals including foxes,
OL,13,Fhedgehogs, rabbits and birds - as well
OL,14,Fas cats, dogs and horses.
OL,16,FThe charity said it is "desperately"
OL,17,Flooking for new land so it can help
OL,18,Fanimals which require specialist
OL,19,Ftreatment.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
